## Interface: 16001
## Title: Guidelime |cff66ff66Forever Shaman 1-30|r
## Notes: Braedyn's Alliance levelling route for WoW Forever - Dwarf Shaman and Dwarf/Human Hunter, class and race steps filtered automatically. 1-20: Eastern Kingdoms, Hall of Thanes + Deadmines (24-25 Sep 2026, audited 17 Oct against QuestieDB Forever 1.0.6). 20-30 (18 Oct 2026): Ruins of Lordaeron, Loch Modan, Redridge, Darkshore, Ashenvale + Blackfathom Deeps, Duskwood, the Stockade, Wetlands, Darnassus, Excavation Site, Hillsbrad, Gnomeregan, Razorfen Kraul - every Alliance dungeon quest in the bracket, Call of Water and Call of Air for the shaman. 25 Oct: launch-crowd layer in 1-15, Call of Water finale moved to Westfall, shaman fixes, Dalaran lead-ins carried from 15/23. 27 Oct: cooking + fishing layer (Longjaw Mud Snapper and Mithril Head Trout food plan, Journeyman/Expert steps, fish-to-N stops, Seasoned Wolf Kabobs), drop-rate pass (Never Saddle on Quality retargeted to Elder Snow Leopards; Show of Force, The Quarry's Smith and Slowing the Orc Advance dropped; kill budgets and one-kill notes). 28 Oct: Cooking-175 steps (Hot Spices at Menethil, cook omelets to 175 at Whelgar) so the Mithril Head Trout opens at 29-30; [TAR] tags on the Minor Manifestation of Earth, Kernobee and Willix. 29 Oct: First Aid thread (bandage-to-N stops at 20/50/75/100/125; Heavy Linen 40 and Journeyman at Nissa Firestone, Wool 80 at Michelle Belle, Heavy Wool 115 at Fremal Doohickey, Expert book at Deneb Walker in Stromgarde on the Call of Air leg - recipe values from the Wowhead Forever spell pages). 1 Nov: Alba's Westfall chain reordered to its QuestieDB 1.0.9 prerequisites (The State of the Mines after the well and gill hand-ins, the Moonbrook crates and the Stormwind explosives chain on the Deadmines trip, one run), Harvesting the Harvesters item-start fixed, Blackrock Blockade made a plain step and handed in before Shadow Magic and Tharil'zun, Alther's Mill left to chapter 10, Holy Diver dropped (0 XP, needs all nine beached quests). Gear calls rescored on the 1 Nov tooltips: thirteen quoted stats corrected (Deepgrave Trousers, Ironforge Greathammer, Rockslicer, Flamefist Grips, Bravo's Armbands and others changed in the October builds); Frontier Britches and Smith's Trousers now replace Deepgrave, Staff of Westfall over the Greathammer when no Deadmines 2H drops, Boots of the People's Militia over statless boots, Garb of Florid Feathers over Raptorbane; roll-if-it-drops notes for Blackened Defias Leggings, Bloodied Chestwraps, Witherbite Bracers and the Electrocutioner Lagnut. Wowhead XP refreshed for all 21 zones; six quoted XP figures corrected (Fishin' Time 680, The Powers Below 1,700, Ira's Dagger 2,000, Gleaming Crescent Necklace 1,600, Mor'Ladim 2,750). 1 Nov (evening): Leatherworking after the 31 Oct hotfix - the Totemic Leather Armor / Pants patterns (no Pristine Leather, tradeable dungeon drops) are now an AH check at every city and merchant-camp pass (07, 10, 15, 16) with the early switch in 07; profession notes in 1-6 and chapter 06 updated. 1 Nov (late): Cozy Sleeping Bag chain - ... and that note you found picked up at Alexston Farmstead (05), handed in and Stepping Stones taken at the burnt tower south of Taurajo on the Kraul ride (26), carried to 30-40. 1 Nov (night): Making Do - Expanding Horizons taken at Thundris in Auberdine (11), handed to Baros Alexston with Making Do taken on the Stockade trip (15), handed in at Thundris on the Darnassus trip (20) for the Shipwright's Satchel, a 6-slot reagent bag. 1 Nov (night, 2): Captain Sanders treasure hunt as [O] steps on the Westfall south loop (05: map from the Longshore murlocs, footlocker west of the quarry, barrel east of Alexston Farmstead, jug by the windmill, chest on the north-west coast; Booty Bag 8-slot and Captain Sander's Locker); chapter 07 note trimmed. 1 Nov (rename): addon renamed from Guidelime_ForeverAlliance to Guidelime_ForeverShaman (group "Forever Shaman 1-30") - delete the old folder if you had it. 1 Nov (release check): the Mor'Ladim chain total in 25-26 corrected to 5,340 XP; Darnassus, Razorfen Kraul and Gnomeregan XP refreshed from Wowhead (every route zone is now on 1 Nov data); a quoted-XP check added to the tooling. 2 Nov: QuestieDB 1.0.10 and client build 1.60.1.70753 - the DB now carries NPC ranks: Incinerator Gar'im (16) and Baron Marinous (11, now GROUP 2+) noted as elite, Giant Wetlands Crocolisk spawn count 19 (18); Wowhead XP re-pulled for every route zone (no XP change). 2 Nov (night): 19-20 Deadmines now rebinds the hearth at Sentinel Hill (Redridge had bound it at Lakeshire and 07-10 hearthed to Sentinel Hill); a hearth-bind check added to check_guide. 2 Nov (research pass): Strong Fishing Pole +5 (tooltip); the Totemic Leather Armor / Pants AH searches replaced by a trainer check (no pattern item exists on Wowhead Forever; the Armor recipe looks trainer-taught, unverified). 3 Nov (launch dev notes): Mental Dexterity is 150% of Int, so the central Int weight went 1.05 -> 1.55 and every gear call was rescored - Deerhide vs Duty Bound (11), Town Clerk's Mittens first (17), Carnage Trousers (19), Snake Hoop runner-up (26), two quoted scores (16, 22), and cloth Int pieces are now taken where they score higher (Repurposed Hair Band 02, Kimbra Boots 09, Zodiac Gloves 14, Windfelt Gloves 20, Acidic Walkers 24, Death Speaker and Batwing Mantle 26); launch respawn note in 00b/01b; client build 70755 is identical to 70753; Wowhead XP re-pulled for every route zone (no change). 3 Nov (sheet review): Call of Water total 9,600 XP (08); Spider Leg / Corpse Chopper are fallbacks below Smite's and Rockslicer (08); the Menethil trout stop at 21-22 now says the +5 pole makes it a long shot (09); a Two-Handed Axes step at Buliwyf Stonehand on the first Ironforge pass (02); Eldrun Stormbreaker and Bruegs Kindleborn moved to their DB spawns (47.1,13.8 and 87.9,44.8); Fire Nova is a spell, not a totem (02). 3 Nov (late): Flametongue Totem / Windfury Totem exclusivity note at the level-28 stop (18); buy 2 Ankh for Reincarnation at Ginny Longberry after the level-30 stop (24). 4 Nov (launch audit of 02-26, from play): trainer, vendor, loot and skill-up steps now hold until the action is done ([T], [V], [QC], [CI], [SK]) instead of completing when you walk within 6 yards; every class-trainer stop lists the sheet's must/buy spells with Forever prices (Wowhead Forever trainer data) and the running quest money, with gold checks before the Loch Modan shopping and the level-20 stop, prices on every buy line, silver on the paying optional turn-ins, the level-18 and level-22 tram trips cut (nothing on the sheet), and the Waylaid Supplies ore crates named as a gold source; cave and interior targets get an entrance step first (Silver Stream Mine, the shrine trail, Grawmug's cave, the Deadmines building, Thelgen Rock, the Den Mother's cave, Vul'Gol, the Tranquil Gardens and Raven Hill crypts, Rethban Caverns, the Howling Vale mouth, Dor'danil, the yeti cave, the Gnomeregan elevator - entrance positions from Classic, unverified). Audit and test list: docs/audit-2026-11-04.md. 5 Nov: the chapter 02 gold check says what to do with Mining output - smelt, sell surplus bars and stone on the Ironforge AH, keep Pyrite, 20 Copper Bars and the 10 Copper + 10 Tin for Morhan's bronze. 5 Nov (money check): quest money quotes corrected from the Wowhead quest data - about 40s by the chapter 02 gold check (was 65-85s), about 9g at the level-24/26 stop (15) and about 18g at the level-30 stop (22); Flint and Tinder 1s 32c (02). 5 Nov (from play): Two-Handed Maces is trained, not known at start - the Buliwyf Stonehand stop (02) trains Maces and Axes, the Anvilmar Sledge and Coldridge Hammer lines (01a, 01b) say to stay on a staff until then. 6 Nov (from play, level 13): Mining dropped for Leatherworking at 13 - the first Ironforge trip (02) now trains at Fimble Finespindle (recipes, Totemic Leather Armor check, skill path to 75), buys thread and salt at Bombus Finespindle, trains Journeyman Skinning at Balthus (75 cap), abandons Camping 101: Mining and offers the Kharanos detour for Camping 101: Leatherworking; the Mining lines in 01a and 02-16 are rewritten for Leatherworking (Light Leather crates at the merchant camp, Pristine Leather and Sulfuric Acid bought on the AH at about 4s each per the 6 Nov scan, patterns from Daniel Stitchsong by skill); Pattern: Totemic Leather Armor is a bind-on-pickup Oggleflint (Ragefire Chasm, Horde) drop in QuestieDB 1.0.11, so the Armor is out unless a trainer teaches it. Grind quests made optional with XP labels: In Defense of the King's Lands 263 (02), Gathering Idols (04), Goretusk Liver Pie and The Coast Isn't Clear (05, 07), Redridge Goulash and Selling Fish (06); Banner of the Fallen optional but recommended (Mountaineer's Greataxe). Rhapsody Malt at Yanni for Beer Basted Boar Ribs (02). Record and test list: docs/audit-2026-11-06.md. The merchant-camp crate notes (01b, 02, 06, 10, 16) now follow Forever's Waylaid Crate model: read the label, fill the category crate with one bundle, hand in to Marcy Baker; the crates are tradeable and 4-22s on the AH, so Favor is nearly free. 6 Nov (round 3, Wowhead Forever NPC/quest pages): Fimble prices and list (no Totemic Leather Armor, no Expert rank), Balthus Journeyman Skinning 5s, Camping 101: Leatherworking 270 XP, Marcy Baker pays 5-30 Merchant's Favor per A Sealed Crate and no money, Shipping Label 660 XP + 50 Favor once, Stitchsong patterns 30 Favor verified, Expert Leatherworking trainer unverified.
